**EP-RP-001** · live

| | |
|---|---|
| Guard | `app` |
| Permission in catalog | `—` — not enforced on /app/rep |
| Idempotency | required |
| Name | إكمال تسجيل المندوب |

🟡 Requires the registration-ability token from verify-otp. Response token replaces it (ability *). zones[].name is null. GET /public/refs is 404 — ids must be known.

Channel must be active; zones must be inside its coverage (TB-RP-010).

**Example `data`:**
```json
{
    "rep": {
        "id": 70,
        "name": "أحمد العلي",
        "channel": {
            "id": 1,
            "name": "شركة النور"
        },
        "zones": [
            {
                "id": 12,
                "name": "المزة"
            }
        ],
        "status": "pending_review"
    },
    "token": "50|rep_xxxxx"
}
```

**EP-RP-021** · live

| | |
|---|---|
| Guard | `app` |
| Permission in catalog | `—` — not enforced on /app/rep |
| Idempotency | required |
| Name | إضافة لسلة محل |

🟡 Increments qty if the (product, variant) exists. No PATCH/DELETE. Resolve product names locally from the catalog cache.

**Example `data`:**
```json
{
    "sections": [
        {
            "retailer": {
                "id": 481,
                "shop_name": "بقالية النور"
            },
            "lines": [
                {
                    "id": 11,
                    "product_id": 880,
                    "qty": 4,
                    "unit_price": 12000
                }
            ],
            "total": 48000,
            "discount": 0
        }
    ]
}
```

**EP-RP-022** · live

| | |
|---|---|
| Guard | `app` |
| Permission in catalog | `—` — not enforced on /app/rep |
